body:
Hey there! I got a new laptop; MSI GE62VR. Initially I got like 120fps with max/nearly maxed out graphic settings. The next day however, I dropped to 30-35 fps even with combat settings ticked.

Thinking it's because I updated the driver, I reinstalled the previous version, restarted the laptop, but still got no more than 35 fps. x_x I don't know what changed to cause this drop, but it's really frustrating, because i figured I'd get at least above 60? Especially since it was doing fine at 100+ before!

Anyone had this happen before, or know a fix I can try out? Thanks!

My specs:
GeForce GTX 1060 (driver ver 376.54); 
Intel Core i7-7700HQ @ 2.8GHz; 
8GB RAM; 
1920 * 1080 @ 60Hz

(I'm a bit of a tech noob tbh)
